*.pyc

# The brand asset generator's caches. The two Open Graph cards ARE
# committed (see assets/brand/generated/), because the build needs them
# and CI cannot run the generator — it installs no packages and has no
# headless Chrome. Everything else in that directory is regenerable with
# `python3.12 make_brand_assets.py` and is not a build input.
assets/brand/Inter.ttf
assets/brand/generated/*
!assets/brand/generated/og-corporate.png
!assets/brand/generated/og-aware.png
